        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T23:27:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Considering one user, `isDeviceSecure()` has to be true for any of the non-trivial authentication methods to be required.  But as mentioned later in the paragraph, there are cases where the lock screen can be showing but only requiring swipe even if `isDeviceSecure()`.",
      "parentUuid": "d21562aa_2039f885",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 725,
        "startChar": 49,
        "endLine": 725,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "26ad28bc93d2b5ac939f4ad8534c858df8a5c5fd",
